==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*slyšati}}, from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*ḱlew-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|cs|/ˈslɪʃɛt/}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-slyšet.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i|aa=uslyšet}}

# to [[hear]]
#: {{uxi|cs|[[špatně]] [[vás]] '''slyším'''.|I can't '''hear''' you very well.}}

====Usage notes====
The verb has two possible imperatives: {{m|cs|slyš}} and {{m|cs|poslyš}}. The first one is very literary, while the other one is used informally. They are not used to express an order, but to keep contact or get into contact with the listener, for example "''Poslyš, Petře, chtěl jsem se tě zeptat, …''". The verb {{m|cs|poslouchat||listen}} is used to express an order connected with perceiving with ears.<ref>{{cite-web|author=|authorlink=|title=Rozkazovací způsob 4. slovesné třídy (leč – léči)|url=http://prirucka.ujc.cas.cz/?id=560&dotaz=posly%C5%A1|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20170713073504/http://prirucka.ujc.cas.cz/?id=560|archivedate=2017-07-13|work=Internetová jazyková příručka|publisher=Ústav pro jazyk český AV ČR|date=|accessdate=2018-03-08}}</ref>

